		{"id":"9d3b11284333828a","type":"text","text":"# Atlas V2: the system map\nSkills (yellow) call tools (cyan). Tools and hooks (green) write documents (purple). Agents read and return data; only skills write. See Atlas V2.md for the rules.","x":0,"y":-300,"width":900,"height":170},
		{"id":"258f4148577d26c5","type":"text","text":"**Legend**\n\n- cyan: tool (code)\n- yellow: skill or agent (model)\n- purple: document or entity\n- green: hook (code, automatic)\n- orange: the user\n- red: a gate or a refusal","x":-400,"y":0,"width":300,"height":260}
